# This project runs on Cloudflare Workers, which reads local settings from
# `.dev.vars` rather than `.env`. See `.dev.vars.example` for the variables:
#
#   SUPABASE_URL              Supabase project URL
#   SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY  Supabase publishable (low-privilege) key
#   PUBLIC_SITE_URL           Base URL used in emailed links
#
# In production, SUPABASE_URL and SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY are set in the
# Cloudflare dashboard (Workers & Pages -> ak-cash-club-website -> Settings ->
# Variables and Secrets). No other secrets are required.
